        "bodyType": "rawHtml",
        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset='UTF-8'><style>body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:#0a0a0f;color:#e0e0e0;margin:0;padding:0}*{box-sizing:border-box}.container{max-width:600px;margin:40px auto;background:#12121a;border:1px solid #2a2a3e;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}.header{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6366f1 0%,#8b5cf6 100%);padding:40px 30px;text-align:center}.header h1{color:#fff;margin:0;font-size:30px;letter-spacing:3px;font-weight:800}.header .sub{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);margin:8px 0 0;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase}.body{padding:36px 32px}.greeting{font-size:20px;color:#a78bfa;margin-bottom:12px;font-weight:600}.message{font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#c0c0d0;margin-bottom:20px}.plan-card{background:#1a1a2e;border:1px solid #6366f1;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 24px;margin:20px 0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px}.plan-icon{font-size:28px}.plan-info .plan-name{font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#a78bfa}.plan-info .plan-price{font-size:13px;color:#888;margin-top:2px}.cta-btn{display:block;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6366f1,#8b5cf6);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;text-align:center;padding:16px 32px;border-radius:10px;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;margin:24px 0;letter-spacing:0.5px}.steps-section{background:#0d0d1a;border:1px solid #1e1e30;border-radius:10px;padding:22px 26px;margin:20px 0}.steps-section h3{color:#a78bfa;margin:0 0 16px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.5px}.step-item{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;margin:12px 0;gap:14px}.step-num{background:#6366f1;color:#fff;border-radius:50%;width:24px;height:24px;min-width:24px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;margin-top:1px}.step-text{font-size:14px;color:#b8b8cc;line-height:1.5}.divider{border:none;border-top:1px solid #1e1e30;margin:24px 0}.note{font-size:13px;color:#666;line-height:1.6}.footer{background:#080810;padding:24px 32px;text-align:center;border-top:1px solid #1a1a2e}.footer .brand{font-size:14px;color:#a78bfa;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;margin-bottom:8px}.footer .info{font-size:11px;color:#444;line-height:1.8}</style></head><body><div class='container'><div class='header'><h1>⚡ SAGE AI</h1><div class='sub'>Autonomous AI Economic OS</div></div><div class='body'><div class='greeting'>ご購入ありがとうございます！🎉</div><div class='message'>Sage AIのサブスクリプションが正常に有効になりました。<br>あなたのプランの詳細は以下の通りです：</div><div class='plan-card'><div class='plan-icon'>{{if(1.amount_total <= 2500, '🔥', '🚀')}}</div><div class='plan-info'><div class='plan-name'>{{if(1.amount_total <= 2500, 'Pro Plan', 'Enterprise Plan')}}</div><div class='plan-price'>{{if(1.amount_total <= 2500, '$20 / 月', '$99 / 月')}} &nbsp;·&nbsp; Stripe Customer ID: {{1.customer}}</div></div></div><a href='https://sage-official-site.pages.dev/dashboard' class='cta-btn'>ダッシュボードへアクセス →</a><div class='steps-section'><h3>🚀 はじめの3ステップ</h3><div class='step-item'><div class='step-num'>1</div><div class='step-text'><strong style='color:#ddd'>ダッシュボードにログイン</strong><br>設定ページでTelegram通知とAPIキーを設定してください</div></div><div class='step-item'><div class='step-num'>2</div><div class='step-text'><strong style='color:#ddd'>コンテンツプールを設定</strong><br>NotionにSNS投稿ネタを追加してSage AIに自動投稿させましょう</div></div><div class='step-item'><div class='step-num'>3</div><div class='step-text'><strong style='color:#ddd'>自律モードをON</strong><br>Job Runnerを起動してSage AIが24時間365日働き始めます</div></div></div><hr class='divider'><div class='note'>ご不明な点や問題がございましたら、このメールに直接返信してください。<br>Sage AIチームが迅速にサポートいたします。</div></div><div class='footer'><div class='brand'>⚡ SAGE AI</div><div class='info'>© 2026 Sage AI — Autonomous AI Economic OS<br>naofumi0930@gmail.com<br><br>このメールはStripe決済完了後に自動送信されています</div></div></div></body></html>"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": { "x": 300, "y": 0 }
      },
      "filter": {
        "name": "checkout.session.completed のみ",
        "conditions": [
          [
            {
              "a": "{{1.type}}",
              "b": "checkout.session.completed",
              "o": "text:equal"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "instant": true,
    "version": 1,
    "scenario": {
      "roundtrips": 1,
      "maxErrors": 3,
      "autoCommit": true,
      "autoCommitTriggerLast": true,
      "sequential": false,
      "confidential": false,
      "dataloss": false,
      "dlq": false,
      "freshVariables": false
    },
